				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">K01=1,44*10^12</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">E1=125000</p>
